{{Quote|Our link to the ground is dead, sir.''"<br />"''Then so is my platoon.|Dreed learns that his platoon is lost|<ref name="PLIII">[[Princess Leia 3|''Princess Leia'' 3]]</ref>}}
[[File:MorakImpRemnant-TMCh15.png|thumb|right|250px|Platoons were used in the armies of various governments including the Galactic Empire.]]
A '''platoon''' was a subdivision of [[soldier]]s in various military forces in [[the galaxy]], such as the [[Grand Army of the Republic]], the [[Separatist Droid Army]], and the [[Imperial Army]]'s [[Stormtrooper Corps]], and the [[First Order Army]]'s [[Stormtrooper Corps (First Order)|Stormtrooper Corps]]. During the [[New Republic Era]], the [[Corporate Sector Authority]] created an [[army]] of [[CSA trooper]]s divided into platoons and other military units. A full CSA platoon comprised twenty [[trooper]]s, and a CSA company was composed of three platoons.

==Overview==
{{Quote|All of them.''"<br />"''All of them? Impossible. That's an entire company. Three platoons.''"<br />"''Plus transport.|Ochi and Coromun|<ref name="SotS">''[[Shadow of the Sith]]''</ref>}}
[[File:Tano_Company_at_attention.png|thumb|left|250px|A platoon was a military unit that consisted of soldiers.]]
Platoons were military units used by various military organizations, such as the [[Grand Army of the Republic]],<ref name="CL">[[Star Wars: Complete Locations (2016)|''Star Wars: Complete Locations'']]</ref> the [[Separatist Droid Army]],<ref name="Bad Batch">{{TCW|The Bad Batch (episode)}}</ref> the [[Galactic Empire]]'s [[Stormtrooper Corps]],<ref name="PLIII" /> and the [[First Order]]'s [[Stormtrooper Corps (First Order)|Stormtrooper Corps]].<ref name="TLO">''[[The Last Order]]''</ref> In the [[Galactic Republic]]'s Grand [[Army]], each [[company]] consisted of four platoons of thirty-six [[soldier]]s, which were each divided into four [[squad]]s. Each platoon was commanded by a [[Clone Lieutenant|clone lieutenant]].<ref name="CL" /> In the Imperial [[Stormtrooper]] Corps, a platoon consisted of five [[squad]]s, giving one a total of fifty stormtroopers. A [[company]] consisted of four Imperial platoons.<ref name="SuperGraphic">''[[Star Wars Super Graphic: A Visual Guide to a Galaxy Far, Far Away]]''</ref> In the army of the [[Corporate Sector Authority]], a company was divided into three platoons; at full strength, a platoon comprised twenty [[CSA trooper]]s.<ref name="SotS" /> [[IG-227 Hailfire-class droid tank|IG-227 ''Hailfire''-class droid tanks]] could be organized into platoons.<ref name="Rise">''[[Rise of the Separatists]]''</ref>

==History==
===Republic Era===
After achieving [[Defeat of the Sith|victory]] over the [[Sith]],<ref name="TSWB">''[[The Star Wars Book]]''</ref> the [[Galactic Republic]] saw no need for a formal military force.<ref name="Episode II">{{Film|II}}</ref> However, smaller defense forces like the [[Republic Defense Coalition]]<ref name="Light of the Jedi">''[[The High Republic: Light of the Jedi]]''</ref> and [[Judicial Forces]] were maintained in defense of Republic interests.<ref name="Tarkin">[[Tarkin (novel)|''Tarkin'']]</ref> A platoon of [[Republic peacekeeping troop]]s was deployed to the holy [[moon]] of [[Jedha]]<ref name="BoJ">''[[The High Republic: The Battle of Jedha]]''</ref> in [[382 BBY]]<ref name="Timelines">''[[Star Wars: Timelines]]''</ref> after "[[Elecia Zeveron|the Mother]]" of the [[Path of the Open Hand]] manipulated events into the [[Battle of Jedha]]. The platoon arrived alongside a group of Jedi and shut down the fighting.<ref name="BoJ" />

[[File:Umbara_platoon.png|thumb|right|250px|A platoon of the 501st Legion served in the Battle of Umbara.]]
When the [[Clone Wars]] began in [[22 BBY]],<ref name="Timelines" /> the Republic created a new [[Grand Army of the Republic]] for itself, with the new force based around the [[clone trooper]]s produced on the planet [[Kamino]]. Meanwhile, the breakaway [[Confederacy of Independent Systems]] deployed a [[battle droid]]-based [[Confederacy military|military]].<ref name="Episode II" /> In the [[Second Battle of Geonosis]], after their [[gunship]] was shot down, [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]] and [[Trapper (clone trooper)|Trapper]] were the only survivors<ref name="Landing at Point Rain">{{TCW|Landing at Point Rain}}</ref> of the platoon aboard.<ref name="Landing at Point Rain AD">{{TCW|Landing at Point Rain}} {{AD|Disney+}}</ref> During the war, the Separatist-aligned [[Umbaran Militia]] ambushed a [[Rex's platoon|clone platoon]] of the [[501st Legion]] led by [[Clone Captain]] [[Rex]] and [[Jedi General]] [[Pong Krell]] during the [[Battle of Umbara]]<ref name="DoU">{{TCW|Darkness on Umbara}}</ref> of [[20 BBY]]. In [[19 BBY]],<ref name="Timelines" /> the [[Battle of Ringo Vinda]] saw a platoon of [[Super battle droid rocket trooper|B2 super rocket troopers]] attacking the forces of the Republic.<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars">''[[Ultimate Star Wars]]''</ref>

===Imperial Era===
{{Quote|I don't know if you've ever commanded your very own platoon of commando droids that you manufactured from an alien queen's robot womb that you kind of, sort of stole from her, but let me tell you: It's a ''rush''. They marched into the place in formation, ready to totally destroy the perfect serenity Commodex Tahn had taken such pains to craft.|Doctor Aphra|<ref name="AphraBook">''[[Doctor Aphra: An Audiobook Original]]''</ref>}}
During a training exercise at the [[Arkanis Academy]], [[Zare Leonis]] was a member of [[Cresh-3 Platoon]].<ref name="secret">''[[Servants of the Empire: The Secret Academy]]''</ref> During the [[Galactic Civil War]], Imperial [[Commander]] [[Dreed]] deployed a platoon of stormtroopers in a [[Sentinel-class landing craft|''Sentinel''-class landing craft]] to the [[planet]] [[Sullust]] in an attempt to capture [[Princess]] [[Leia Skywalker Organa Solo|Leia Organa]] while she was trying to [[Mission to rescue the survivors of Alderaan|rescue]] an [[Alderaan Enclave]] located there. The platoon attacked the [[Alderaanian]]s in the enclave but were defeated and [[Death|killed]] when Organa led a herd of [[rockrender]]s into the battle.<ref name="PLIII" />

[[File:VadersDroidSoldiers-2015DarthVader5.png|thumb|left|250px|Two platoons of BX-series droid commandos were activated to serve as a private army for Darth Vader.]]
Seeking [[Darth Vader's secret forces|secret forces]] who would be his to command alone,<ref name="V3">[[Darth Vader (2015) 3|''Darth Vader'' (2015) 3]]</ref> the [[Sith Lord]] [[Anakin Skywalker|Darth Vader]] used a [[droid]] [[factory]] to produce two platoons of [[BX-series droid commando]]s which he then led in an [[Skirmish in Cylo's research base|assault]] on the [[Cylo's base|research base]] of the [[scientist]] [[Doctor]] [[Cylo]]. One of the platoons was destroyed in the attack by the [[twin]]s [[Morit Astarte]] and [[Aiolin Astarte]], who had been [[Cybernetics|cybernetically]] enhanced by Cylo to replace Vader.<ref name="V5">[[Darth Vader (2015) 5|''Darth Vader'' (2015) 5]]</ref> Vader's personal agent [[Doctor]] [[Chelli Lona Aphra]] then took command of another platoon of commando droids to [[Assault on Commodex Tahn's villa|break into]] the [[Commodex Tahn's villa|private villa]] of the [[Naboo (people)|Naboo]] [[mortician]] [[Commodex Tahn]], who had information that Vader was interested in.<ref name="AphraBook" />

===New Republic Era===
The [[Gideon's Imperial remnant|Imperial remnant]] led by [[Moff]] [[Gideon]] had a platoon of [[Phase-III Dark Trooper|dark troopers]], though they were destroyed by the Mandalorian [[Din Djarin]] and [[Jedi]] [[Luke Skywalker]].<ref name="Chapter 16">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 16: The Rescue}}</ref> During the [[New Republic Era]], [[Viceprex]] [[Coromun]] was ordered by his [[commanding officer]], [[Enric Pryde|Steadfast]], to assign three platoons&mdash;a full company&mdash;of CSA [[trooper]]s to assist the [[Jedi hunter]] [[Ochi]] in the search for [[Dathan]], [[Miramir]], and [[Rey Skywalker|Rey]].<ref name="SotS" /> The [[Stormtrooper Corps (First Order)|Stormtrooper Corps]] of the emerging [[First Order]], the successor to the Empire, also made use of platoons.<ref name="TLO" />

